</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">vp check
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 构建</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">vp build
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 运行 ts 文件</span>
